  "goodToKnow": "Der or die Promi is a colloquial short form of der/die Prominente (a celebrity), from prominent (famous). Typical phrases: Promi-Klatsch (celebrity gossip), die Promi-Hochzeit, die B-Promis (minor celebs). German reality TV is full of Promi-shows like Promi Big Brother. The more formal word is die Berühmtheit. Prominenz means the famous people collectively: die ganze Prominenz war da. Plural: die Promis."
